flowchart LR
    WA[WhatsApp] <-->|Baileys websocket| PKG[WhatsApp provider]
    PKG -->|inbound event| HOST[Crab bridge host]
    HOST -->|selected text| PKG
    PKG -->|credential snapshot<br/>previous hash| CAS{active instance<br/>and hash match?}
    CAS -->|yes| FILE[(opaque credential file)]
    FILE -->|durable ack| PKG
    CAS -->|no| STOP[reject and restart]
    HOST --> INBOX[(durable trigger inbox)]
